<div class="mt-4 p-4 bg-green-500/10 border border-green-500/30 rounded-xl animate-fade-in-up shadow-lg shadow-green-900/20">
  <div class="flex items-center mb-3">
    <div class="h-8 w-8 rounded-full bg-green-500 flex items-center justify-center mr-3 shadow-md shadow-green-500/30">
      <i class="ph ph-check text-white font-bold"></i>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4 class="font-bold text-white tracking-tight">자동 입찰 제출 성공!</h4>
      <p class="text-xs text-green-200 font-medium"><%= Time.now.strftime("%H:%M:%S") %> • AI 검증 완료</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  
  <div class="space-y-2 text-sm pl-11 mb-3">
    <div class="flex justify-between items-center p-2 rounded-lg bg-white/5 border border-white/5">
      <span class="text-indigo-200 text-xs">나의 입찰가</span>
      <span class="text-white font-mono font-bold"><%= number_to_currency(user_price, unit: "", precision: 0) %><span class="text-xs font-normal text-indigo-300 ml-1">원</span></span>
    </div>
    <div class="flex justify-between items-center p-2 rounded-lg bg-white/5 border border-white/5">
        <% diff = ((user_price - bid.predicted_price) / bid.predicted_price * 100).round(1) %>
      <span class="text-indigo-200 text-xs flex items-center"><i class="ph ph-trend-up mr-1 opacity-70"></i> AI 예측 대비</span>
      <span class="<%= diff > 0 ? 'text-red-300' : 'text-emerald-300' %> font-mono font-bold"><%= diff > 0 ? "+#{diff}%" : "#{diff}%" %></span>
    </div>
  </div>
  
  <div class="mt-3 pl-11">
      <div class="h-1.5 w-full bg-gray-700/50 rounded-full overflow-hidden backdrop-blur-sm">
        <div class="h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-green-500 to-emerald-400 w-full animate-[progress_2s_ease-out]"></div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-[10px] text-center text-indigo-300/50 mt-1.5 flex items-center justify-center">
        <i class="ph ph-lock-key mr-1"></i> 전자서명 암호화 및 블록체인 기록 완료
      </p>
  </div>
</div>
